\item[S2] Gerhard Frey, \emph{Duality in Arithmetic Geometry and Applications to Discrete Logarithms}, IPAM Number Theory and Cryptography: Open Problems workshop (9--13 October 2006), Problem 2 and definition of Pic, PDF pages 13--14. \url{https://helper.ipam.ucla.edu/publications/SCWS1/SCWS1_6219.pdf}.
